NOTE ON SCOPE

This MIT license covers the skill documents, the installer, and the surrounding
code in this repository — the original reference prose written for this project.

It does not and cannot cover Edward Tufte's published work. The skills in this
repository are original documents explaining Tufte's principles in their own
words. Direct quotations are brief, single-sentence, and attributed, used for
educational commentary rather than reproduction. Those quotations remain the
property of their copyright holders. The five source books are published by
Graphics Press and must be purchased separately.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Edward Tufte or Graphics Press.
